{"id": "1792325", "name": "נגזרת – חזקה של 1/cos(kx) או 1/sin(kx)", "defaultgrade": 1, "penalty": 0.1, "options": {"multiplicationsign": "dot", "complexno": "i", "matrixparens": "[", "inversetrig": "arccos", "logicsymbol": "lang", "sqrtsign": true}, "nhints": 0, "questiontext": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\"><div style=\"background:#F4F1F5;border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px\"><div style=\"font-weight:bold;color:#4b1f6f;margin-bottom:6px\">נגזרת – חזקה של הופכי פונקציה טריגונומטרית</div><p>מצאו את הנגזרת של הפונקציה</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ \\displaystyle f\\left(x\\right)={{CT:0}} \\]</p></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:14px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><div style=\"background:#FAF9FB;border-radius:8px;padding:10px;direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate\">\\( \\displaystyle f'\\left(x\\right)= \\) [[input:ans1]]</div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate;margin-top:6px\">[[validation:ans1]]</div></div></div>", "generalfeedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\"><div style=\"background:#F4F1F5;border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:12px 16px;margin-bottom:12px\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">מבנה הפתרון:</b> כותבים את הפונקציה כחזקה של הופכי הביטוי הטריגונומטרי, וגוזרים לפי כלל השרשרת.</div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">שלב 1 — כתיבה כחזקה</b><br>נכתוב את הפונקציה כחזקה של הופכי הביטוי הטריגונומטרי<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ f\\left(x\\right)=\\left(\\frac{1}{{{CT:1}}}\\right)^{{{CT:2}}}=\\left({{CT:1}}\\right)^{-{{CT:2}}} \\]</p></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">שלב 2 — כלל השרשרת</b><br>נסמן <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(u\\left(x\\right)={{CT:1}}\\)</span>, ואז <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(u'\\left(x\\right)={{CT:3}}\\)</span>. לפי כלל השרשרת<div style=\"background:#FFF8E6;border:1px solid #E8D29A;border-radius:10px;padding:10px 14px;margin:12px 0\">כלל השרשרת: <span dir=\"ltr\">\\( \\frac{d}{dx}f(g(x))=f'(g(x))\\,g'(x) \\)</span></div><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ f'\\left(x\\right)=-{{CT:2}}u\\left(x\\right)^{-{{CT:4}}}u'\\left(x\\right)=-{{CT:2}}\\left({{CT:1}}\\right)^{-{{CT:4}}}\\cdot\\left({{CT:3}}\\right)={{CT:5}} \\]</p></div></div>", "specificfeedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\">[[feedback:Result]]</div>", "prtcorrect": "<p dir=\"rtl\"><span class=\"correct\">תשובה נכונה.</span></p>", "prtpartiallycorrect": "<p dir=\"rtl\"><span class=\"partially\">התשובה נכונה חלקית.</span></p>", "prtincorrect": "<p dir=\"rtl\"><span class=\"incorrect\">התשובה אינה נכונה.</span></p>", "inputs": [{"name": "ans1", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 42, "insertstars": 1, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 2, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}], "prts": [{"name": "Result", "value": 1, "autosimplify": true, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "varss:listofvars(ans1);\nan1:ans1;\nfor i:1 while i<=length(varss) do an1:ev(an1,varss[i]=v);", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "Diff", "sans": "an1", "tans": "diff(p,v)", "testoptions": "v", "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 1, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "Result-0-T ", "feedback": ""}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": 1, "answernote": "Result-0-F ", "feedback": ""}}, {"name": 1, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "an1", "tans": "-diff(p,v)", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0.5, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "Result-1-T ", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\"><p>יש כאן טעות סימן בלבד.</p></div>"}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": 2, "answernote": "Result-1-F ", "feedback": ""}}, {"name": 2, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "an1", "tans": "diff(p,v)/diff(pp,v)", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "Result-2-T ", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\"><p>חסר גורם שמתקבל מגזירת הפונקציה הטריגונומטרית הפנימית.</p></div>"}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "Result-2-F ", "feedback": ""}}]}], "qvnames": ["k", "p", "pp", "q", "rdm", "ttt", "v"], "nvariants": 32}